<!--
  SYNTHETIC FIXTURE - NOT A REAL CAPTURE.

  Hand-built from the structure documented in the ENTSO-E Transparency
  Platform RESTful API user guide, so the mapper can be developed before
  API credentials arrive. Replace it with a real response the moment the
  token works, and re-run the tests: element order, optional elements and
  the exact timestamp format are the things most likely to differ.

  Deliberate properties, each one exercising a branch of the mapper:
    - timeInterval timestamps have NO seconds (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MMZ), which
      is how the guide documents them and is not a format DataWeave
      coerces to DateTime without help.
    - curveType is A01, so all 24 positions are present.
    - Prices include a negative value (position 15) and a zero
      (position 14), which is the case the alerting half of the project
      exists to catch.
    - The day is 2026-09-18 in DE-LU: 22:00Z on the 17th to 22:00Z on
      the 18th, because Berlin is UTC+2 in September.
-->
